WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.742
Watch and read: Ama asks: A class sings a song about kindness. What does its message

00:00:05.742 --> 00:00:06.088
encourage?

00:00:06.950 --> 00:00:11.769
The answer is: help one another. Explain the message of a song using the words and

00:00:11.769 --> 00:00:12.070
actions.

00:00:12.950 --> 00:00:17.750
Watch and read: Ama asks: What does this rhyme mean: “Rain, rain, help seeds grow”?

00:00:18.617 --> 00:00:23.929
The answer is: Rain helps plants grow. Explain a rhyme in simple, everyday words.
